WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.084 --> 00:00:12.727
It's Career Day.

2
00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:17.578
My class is learning about different jobs.

3
00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:21.542
Miss Wilson is a chef.

4
00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:25.002
She cooks delicious meals.

5
00:00:25.003 --> 00:00:28.366
She works at a restaurant.

6
00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:32.871
Mr. Smith is a photographer.

7
00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:36.344
He takes pictures of babies.

8
00:00:36.345 --> 00:00:39.843
He works at a studio.

9
00:00:39.844 --> 00:00:44.315
Mr. Lewis is a car designer.

10
00:00:44.316 --> 00:00:47.175
He designs cars.

11
00:00:47.176 --> 00:00:50.917
He works at a car company.

12
00:00:50.918 --> 00:00:55.194
Dr. White is a dentist.

13
00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:58.219
She checks people's teeth.

14
00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:02.332
She works at a dentist's office.

15
00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:06.522
Mrs. Jones is a vet.

16
00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:10.181
She takes care of sick animals.

17
00:01:10.182 --> 00:01:14.215
She works at an animal hospital.

18
00:01:14.216 --> 00:01:18.573
Professor Allen is a scientist.

19
00:01:18.574 --> 00:01:21.573
He studies science.

20
00:01:21.574 --> 00:01:28.560
He works at a university.

21
00:01:28.561 --> 00:01:30.668
Career Day is fun!

22
00:01:30.669 --> 00:01:34.155
There are lots of fun jobs.

23
00:01:34.156 --> 00:01:41.350
What do you want to be when you grow up?
